MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink whole-home bundle feels like a useful next step because it builds on my door alarms and works with the Alexa devices I already use, adding a new capability to my home setup.",
    "The newer Fire HD 10 appeals to me because a larger portable entertainment screen serves a different purpose from my Fire TV and small Echo Show."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Fire TV Stick 4K and older Echo models repeat roles already filled by my Fire TV Stick 4K Max, fourth-generation Dot, and second-generation Show 5, so their familiarity gives me little reason to choose them now.",
    "Several alternatives interest me without being additional purchases: I would choose the newer HD 10 over the other tablets and start with the whole-home security bundle before adding three indoor cameras."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My recent Alexa purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to offer more Alexa devices, even when they add little to what I already have.",
    "My interest in a particular device seems to have been extended to older versions and close substitutes, although those are less useful after a recent purchase."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Show 5 stand purchase suggests I am completing that setup, which makes another small Alexa display a lower priority.",
    "What matters now is whether something adds a useful function: connected security or a portable entertainment screen is more compelling than another device doing an existing job."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in connected home devices and entertainment but underestimated how much my recent purchases already cover those needs."
}
